1
00:00:00,614 --> 00:00:01,614
(Raj:)Oh.

2
00:00:01,615 --> 00:00:02,785
(Penny:)Well, you do.

3
00:00:02,783 --> 00:00:04,283
(Leonard:)Oh. Thank you.

4
00:00:04,284 --> 00:00:05,914
(Penny:)Yeah.

5
00:00:05,919 --> 00:00:08,689
You're gonna be on Skype;
they're not gonna see your legs.

6
00:00:08,689 --> 00:00:10,759
(Leonard:)Well, I'm gonna go put on
some pants just in case.

7
00:00:10,758 --> 00:00:13,328
(Leonard:)But I have to say,
this is very freeing.

8
00:00:13,327 --> 00:00:15,297
(chuckles)

9
00:00:15,295 --> 00:00:18,595
(Penny:)Add a belt and I'll take you
someplace nice.

10
00:00:18,599 --> 00:00:19,599
(Raj:)Oh.

11
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,670
(Leonard:)Done and done.

12
00:00:28,174 --> 00:00:30,514
(Howard:)Okay, I think
I've narrowed it down

13
00:00:30,511 --> 00:00:33,481
(Howard:)to a faulty pin on
the onboard communication chip.

14
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:36,350
(Sheldon:)Very impressive.

15
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,180
(Sheldon:)You know, when you're
done with that,

16
00:00:38,185 --> 00:00:41,055
(Sheldon:)can you look at this?

17
00:00:42,355 --> 00:00:44,725
(Sheldon:)It doesn't make smoke anymore.

18
00:00:44,725 --> 00:00:46,825
(Howard:)One toy at a time.

19
00:00:46,827 --> 00:00:48,157
(Sheldon:)Mm. Sorry.

20
00:00:48,162 --> 00:00:49,662
(Sheldon:)Ah, maybe it's for the best.

21
00:00:49,663 --> 00:00:51,833
(Sheldon:)I hear locomotive smoke

22
00:00:51,832 --> 00:00:55,802
(Sheldon:)is the second leading cause of
death among train aficionados.

23
00:00:55,803 --> 00:00:57,173
(Raj:)What's the first one?

24
00:00:57,171 --> 00:00:59,241
(Howard:)Suicide.

25
00:00:59,239 --> 00:01:00,739
(Sheldon:)Wrong.

